{"id":"55094a403a51c25e","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-equational-class.md","title":"Equational Class","display":"df-equational-class — Equational Class","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-equational-class","aliases":["93-df-equational-class"],"display":"df-equational-class — Equational Class","depends_on":["[[93-df-equation]]","[[93-df-model]]","[[93-df-deterministic]]","[[93-df-algebra]]","[[93-df-similarity-type]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-equational-class"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-equational-class</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-equational-class — Equational Class"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1e2cbe43bd24f67f\" href=\"?note=1e2cbe43bd24f67f\" title=\"93-df-equation\">93-df-equation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2e6273b8ebf2e31a\" href=\"?note=2e6273b8ebf2e31a\" title=\"93-df-model\">93-df-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"096eaa05407a0ec3\" href=\"?note=096eaa05407a0ec3\" title=\"93-df-deterministic\">93-df-deterministic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6730349967b8ffce\" href=\"?note=6730349967b8ffce\" title=\"93-df-algebra\">93-df-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" href=\"?note=ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" title=\"93-df-similarity-type\">93-df-similarity-type</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle\">\\(\\tau=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle\\)</span> is a similarity type, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X=\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\">\\(X=\\mathrm{Var}_{93}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Eq}_{\\tau}(X)\">\\(\\mathrm{Eq}_{\\tau}(X)\\)</span> is the equation set of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"1e2cbe43bd24f67f\" href=\"?note=1e2cbe43bd24f67f\" title=\"93-df-equation\">93-df-equation</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SimilarityType}\">\\(\\mathrm{SimilarityType}\\)</span> is the sourced similarity-type predicate.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}\">\\(\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}\\)</span> is the algebra predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"6730349967b8ffce\" href=\"?note=6730349967b8ffce\" title=\"93-df-algebra\">93-df-algebra</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Eval}^{\\mathbf A,\\tau}_{v}\">\\(\\operatorname{Eval}^{\\mathbf A,\\tau}_{v}\\)</span> is the recursively defined term evaluation of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"096eaa05407a0ec3\" href=\"?note=096eaa05407a0ec3\" title=\"93-df-deterministic\">93-df-deterministic</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models^{\\mathrm{eq}}_{\\tau,X}\">\\(\\models^{\\mathrm{eq}}_{\\tau,X}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Mod}^{\\mathrm{eq}}_{\\tau,X}\">\\(\\operatorname{Mod}^{\\mathrm{eq}}_{\\tau,X}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EqClass}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{EqClass}_{93}\\)</span> are defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}equational\\text{-}class}\\vdash\\mathbf A\\models^{\\mathrm{eq}}_{\\tau,X}\\langle s,t\\rangle\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\land\\mathrm{Eq}_{93}(s,t;\\tau,X)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall v\\;\\bigl((v:X\\to|\\mathbf A|)\\to\n\\operatorname{Eval}^{\\mathbf A,\\tau}_{v}(s)=\n\\operatorname{Eval}^{\\mathbf A,\\tau}_{v}(t)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}equational\\text{-}class}\\vdash\\mathbf A\\models^{\\mathrm{eq}}_{\\tau,X}\\langle s,t\\rangle\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\land\\mathrm{Eq}_{93}(s,t;\\tau,X)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall v\\;\\bigl((v:X\\to|\\mathbf A|)\\to\n\\operatorname{Eval}^{\\mathbf A,\\tau}_{v}(s)=\n\\operatorname{Eval}^{\\mathbf A,\\tau}_{v}(t)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}equational\\text{-}class}\\vdash\\operatorname{Mod}^{\\mathrm{eq}}_{\\tau,X}(E)\\coloneqq\\{\\mathbf A:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\land\\forall\\varepsilon\\in E\\;(\\mathbf A\\models^{\\mathrm{eq}}_{\\tau,X}\\varepsilon)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}equational\\text{-}class}\\vdash\\operatorname{Mod}^{\\mathrm{eq}}_{\\tau,X}(E)\\coloneqq\\{\\mathbf A:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\land\\forall\\varepsilon\\in E\\;(\\mathbf A\\models^{\\mathrm{eq}}_{\\tau,X}\\varepsilon)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}equational\\text{-}class}\\vdash\\mathrm{EqClass}_{93}(\\mathcal K,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists S\\;\\exists\\alpha\\;\\Bigl[\n\\tau=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{SimilarityType}(S,\\alpha)\n\\land\\exists E\\subseteq\\mathrm{Eq}_{\\tau}(\\mathrm{Var}_{93})\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathcal K=\\operatorname{Mod}^{\\mathrm{eq}}_{\\tau,\\mathrm{Var}_{93}}(E)\\bigr)\\Bigr]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}equational\\text{-}class}\\vdash\\mathrm{EqClass}_{93}(\\mathcal K,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists S\\;\\exists\\alpha\\;\\Bigl[\n\\tau=\\langle S,\\alpha\\rangle\n\\land\\mathrm{SimilarityType}(S,\\alpha)\n\\land\\exists E\\subseteq\\mathrm{Eq}_{\\tau}(\\mathrm{Var}_{93})\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathcal K=\\operatorname{Mod}^{\\mathrm{eq}}_{\\tau,\\mathrm{Var}_{93}}(E)\\bigr)\\Bigr]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Syntax and satisfaction are separated: equations are ordered pairs of terms, while validity quantifies over every valuation into a typed algebra. Both syntax and semantics carry the same complete similarity type <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-equation","status":"resolved","id":"1e2cbe43bd24f67f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-equation]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-model","status":"resolved","id":"2e6273b8ebf2e31a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-deterministic","status":"resolved","id":"096eaa05407a0ec3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-deterministic]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"6730349967b8ffce","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-similarity-type","status":"resolved","id":"ee84ed8b0fae5bc3","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-similarity-type]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-equation","status":"resolved","id":"1e2cbe43bd24f67f","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]",